<title>USA: Pakistan seeks 376,000 tonnes white wheat - embassy.</title>
<headline>Pakistan seeks 376,000 tonnes white wheat - embassy.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan will seek 376,000 tonnes of U.S. and/or Australian white wheat on May 28, according to a Pakistan embassy official.  </p>
<p>&quot;Offers must be received on Wednesday, May 28,&quot; the official said, speaking from his Washington D.C., office.</p>
<p>Pakistan was tendering for U.S. soft white wheat in bulk and/or Australian white milling wheat in bulk, he said.</p>
<p>The shipment period was slated for June 11-July 10.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
